                    <p>
                        nittavinōta-vaḷanāṭṭu v<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>racōḻa-vaḷanāṭṭu <hi rend="grantha">tribhu</hi>vaṉa-<hi rend="grantha">mahāde</hi>vi-<hi rend="grantha">c-caturvvedi</hi>maṅkalattu
