                    </p>                    
                    <p>
                        rā<hi rend="grantha">jendra-siṃha</hi>-vaḷanāṭṭu-t taṉiyūr v<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>ra-nārāyaṇa-<hi rend="grantha">c-caturvvedi</hi>-maṅgalattu <hi rend="grantha">bhā</hi>
                        <lb n="1r3=3" break="no"/><hi rend="grantha"><choice><sic>ra</sic><corr>r</corr></choice>gga</hi>va-<hi rend="grantha">gotra</hi>ttu <hi rend="grantha">Āśvalā</hi>yaṉa-<hi rend="grantha">sūtra</hi>ttu Iṟaiyāṉaraicūr <hi rend="grantha">ma</hi>tisūtaṉa-ya<hi rend="grantha">jña</hi>-p-piriya-<hi rend="grantha">bha</hi>ṭṭaṉukku-p
                        pa
                        <lb n="1r4=4" break="no"/>ṅk' oṉṟu <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g>
                    </p>
                    
                    
                    
