                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <hi rend="grantha">vyā</hi>karaṇa-p-paṭṭa-virutti-nila<supplied reason="subaudible">m</supplied> nal vē
                        <lb n="32v10=1448" break="no"/>li <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g>
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        paviḻiya-k-kiṭ<choice><sic>a</sic><corr>ai</corr></choice>-p-puṟattukku nilam Iru vēli <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g>
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <hi rend="grantha">tai</hi>tti<supplied reason="omitted">ri</supplied>ya-k-kiṭai-p-puṟam nilam Iru vēli <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g>
                    </p>
                    <p>
