                        <lb n="32v11=1449" break="no"/>ya-k-kiṭai-p-puṟam Iru vēli <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g>
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <choice><orig><hi rend="grantha">sa</hi>n=tō<hi rend="grantha">ha</hi></orig><reg><hi rend="grantha">chandoga</hi></reg></choice>-k-kiṭai-p-puṟam nilam Iru vēli <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g>
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <hi rend="grantha">A<choice><orig>dh</orig><reg>th</reg></choice>arvva</hi>-k-kiṭai-p-puṟam nilam Iru <supplied reason="omitted">v</supplied>ē
                        <lb n="32v12=1450" break="no"/>li <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g>
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        talav<choice><sic>u</sic><corr>a</corr></choice><unclear>kara-k-ki</unclear>ṭai-p-puṟam nilam Iru vēli <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g>
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <hi rend="grantha">rūpā</hi>vatara-k-kiṭai-p-puṟam nilam Iru vēli <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g>
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <hi rend="grantha">smr̥</hi>ti-mūla
                        <lb n="32v13=1451" break="no"/>-<hi rend="grantha">gran<choice><orig>dh</orig><reg>th</reg></choice>a</hi>m Ōtuvippaṉukku nilam Iru vēli <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g>
                    </p>
                    <p>                
                        <hi rend="grantha">bhāra</hi>tam vācippāṉukku nilam Iru vēli <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g>
                    </p>
                    <p>Ampalam <unclear>m</unclear>e
                        <lb n="32v14=1452" break="no"/>ḻuki-t toṭṭi-niṟaiccu-t taṇṇ<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>r aṭṭuvāṉukku nilam Iru vēli <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g>
                    </p>
                    <p>vi<hi rend="grantha">ṣa-bho</hi>gattukku nilam Iru vēli <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g>
                    </p>
                    <p>kusava
                        <lb n="32v15=1453" break="no"/>rkku
                        nilam vēli <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g>
                    </p>
                    <p>taiccar kollarkku nilam vēli <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g>
                    </p>
                    <p>Ivv-ūr <hi rend="grantha">śāsa</hi>ṉam veṭṭi <hi rend="grantha">pū<choice><sic>rjj</sic><corr>j</corr></choice>ai</hi>
                        <lb n="32v16=1454" break="no"/>y-aḵa-p peṟra <hi rend="grantha">kāṣtha</hi>kāri <hi rend="grantha">kr̥ṣṇa</hi>ṉ araṅkan-āṉa <hi rend="grantha">tribhu</hi>vaṉa-<hi rend="grantha">mahā-de</hi>vi-p-pēr-ācāriyaṉukku-t tuṇi
                        <lb n="32v17=1455"/>nilam vēli <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g></p>
                    <p>Ivv-ūr <hi rend="grantha">śāsa</hi>ṉam veṭṭi <hi rend="grantha">pū<choice><orig>jj</orig><reg>j</reg></choice>ai</hi> y-aḵa-p peṟṟa <hi rend="grantha">kāṣṭha</hi>kāri Ārāvamutu-<hi rend="grantha">puruṣo</hi>
                        <lb n="32v18=1456" break="no"/>t=tamaṉ-āṉa <hi rend="grantha">rājendrasiṃha</hi>-p-pēr-ācāriyaṉukku-t tuṇi nilam vēli <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g> <g ref="sym:tam-pillaiyarCuli" type="punctuation">.</g> <g ref="sym:tam-pillaiyarCuli" type="punctuation">.</g> <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g> <g ref="sym:tam-pillaiyarCuli" type="punctuation">.</g> <g ref="sym:tam-pillaiyarCuli" type="punctuation">.</g></p>
