                <div type="textpart" n="B" xml:lang="san-Latn" rendition="class:grantha maturity:vernacular"><head>Plates: Sanskrit Portion</head>
                    <p>Nārāyaṇa, the poet of the present Sanskrit <foreign>praśasti</foreign>, is also that of the <ref target="DHARMA_INSTamilNadu01007">Ecālam plates</ref>. Compare stanzas 73 and 76 here with stanzas 33-34 of the Ecālam plates.</p>
